  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Welcome to a realm where shapes weave together in a seamless dance of
    color and magic, and every fusion uncovers a fresh spark of wonder.\nIn PinkoSaga,
    runes, crystals, and glowing marvels fill the board\u2014merge three or more
    matching elements to evolve them into ever more mysterious and mighty forms.
    Each fusion charges your arsenal and reveals pathways to new, uncharted combinations.\nSpend
    your Saga Points to unlock ten enchanting short tales\u2014each fragment delivers
    warmth and meaning, as though you\u2019ve stepped into the role of an ancient
    legend\u2019s hero.\nEnjoy a tranquil pace, bask in a fairy-tale\u2013inspired
    art style, and relax in an unhurried atmosphere with no timers or stress\u2014here,
    every moment, every choice, and every new form truly matters.\nWhether you\u2019re
    a strategist crafting the perfect merge chain, a collector of rare relics, or
    a lover of heartfelt narratives\u2014PinkoSaga invites you to dive into a harmony
    of color and story. The Saga\u2019s universe awaits\u2026 are you ready to weave
    your legend?\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
